  "description": "The windtrap is one of the clearest statements of the mod's fantasy. It is not a machine that creates comfort. It is a machine that buys continuity.\n\nA good windtrap rewards the player for reading the map, respecting exposure, and building around survival first. Once it is online, the colony begins to feel less like a crash site and more like a sietch with a future.",
